### ====================================================================
### MedFlow - verificacao da infraestrutura
### Use o HTTP Client do IntelliJ (ou a extensao REST Client do VS Code).
### ====================================================================

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@eureka = http://localhost:8761

### 1. Painel do Discovery Server (abrir no navegador)
GET {{eureka}}

### 2. Servicos registrados no Eureka (JSON)
GET {{eureka}}/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

### 3. Saude do API Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health

### 4. Rotas configuradas no API Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/gateway/routes

### 5. Saude de cada microservice (acesso direto, so para conferencia)
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health

###
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health

###
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/health

### 6. Identificacao de quem respondeu, passando PELO GATEWAY
###    Prova que o cliente externo nao precisa conhecer as portas internas.
GET {{gateway}}/api/patients/info

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/appointments/info

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/medical-records/info
